❗️The eSafety commissioner, Julie Inman Grant, has followed Russia's lead in taking messaging service Telegram to court over its alleged failure to detect and remove pro-terror material from its platform.

The eSafety commissioner conducted a year-long investigation into the platform and alleges Telegram has failed to comply with Australian codes and standards regarding pro-terror material.

